# Minimal blacklist .gitignore - shared-collaborator pattern.
# Per .ai_instructions/00_START_HERE_README_AI.md and .ai_instructions/02_GIT.md.
#
# This repo is a small private collaboration. Most project artifacts are tracked
# by default so collaborators see source, instructions, research, scoring logs,
# and coordination indexes.
# Only excluded: per-machine environments, secrets, agent-local storage, and
# heavyweight/regenerable competition data and model payloads.
#
# This .gitignore is itself tracked (collaborator clones get the same view).

# --- Python virtual environments + local tool caches (per-machine, large) ---
.venv*/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
build/
dist/

# --- IDE / editor / OS junk (per-machine) ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Secrets / credentials (security - never commit) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.kaggle/
kaggle.json
*.token
*.key
*.pem
credentials.json
secrets.json

# --- Agent-local storage ---
.claude/
MEMORY.md
memory/

# --- Agenters run transcripts (regenerable/noisy; keep prompts, finals, ledgers) ---
Agenters/Orchestrator/runs/**/*.jsonl
Agenters/Orchestrator/runs/**/*.err
Agenters/Orchestrator/runs/**/*.txt
Agenters/Orchestrator/runs/**/*.json
# .csv slipped past this list once and tracked a 402-row per-teammate attribution
# table (task -> creator -> cost -> points). Run output is scratch; keep it all out.
Agenters/Orchestrator/runs/**/*.csv
!Agenters/Orchestrator/runs/_template/*.csv
!Agenters/Orchestrator/runs/beta_p8c_claude_cli/*.csv

# --- Agenters transient queue state (inboxes/probes/acks; regenerable, keep the dir READMEs) ---
Agenters/Submit_Captain/Updates_*/*
!Agenters/Submit_Captain/Updates_*/README.md
Agenters/Submit_Captain/_probe/*
!Agenters/Submit_Captain/_probe/README.md
Agenters/Librarian/Updates_*/*
!Agenters/Librarian/Updates_*/README.md

# --- Hermes/Codex board scratch (local runtime state, never shared) ---
.hermes/
_hermes_archive/
# Never commit ad-hoc *.bak_t_* snapshots; rely on git history instead.
*.bak_t_*
*.bak

# --- staged_submits/ retired inbox; active candidates are task-local ---
staged_submits/**
!staged_submits/
!staged_submits/README.md

# --- Large/regenerable Kaggle source data ---
data/

# --- GUI duplicated task payloads (regenerate from data/competitions/neurogolf-2026) ---
GUI/client/public/tasks/task*.json
!GUI/client/public/tasks/README.md

# --- Regenerable runtime/profiler output ---
local_profiler/
onnxruntime_profile*.json

# --- Archived pilot artifacts (large, reference-only) ---
# Historical root scratch; no current root junction. If recreated locally, keep
# it out of git (see WHERE_DATA_LIVES.md).
BatchPilotArchive/

# --- Generated model payloads ---
# submissions/ is a real in-repo directory. Keep generated per-task ONNXs out of
# git while preserving the shared upload payloads and breadcrumb docs.
*.onnx
submissions/**
!submissions/
# Live upload payloads are small (~1 MB each) and shared with collaborators:
!submissions/submission.zip
!submissions/blend.zip
!submissions/current_best_manifest.json
# Breadcrumb README for the junctioned submissions/ dir:
!submissions/README.md

# --- Vendored skills (per-machine, never committed) ---
# Handoff/skills/handoff-workflows/ was a Windows directory junction to the sibling
# Boladi_Skillz HandOffz skill (see WHERE_DATA_LIVES.md); the 2026-07 archive pass
# materialized it into real files. Either way it stays out of git — a vendored copy
# would drift from the skills library.
Handoff/skills/handoff-workflows/
# Breadcrumb README for the vendored skills/ dir:
!Handoff/skills/README.md

# --- Session scratch ---
git_updates.md
work/
tmp/
repo/
# Local-only heavyweight payload (venv, Kaggle data, submission archives, orchestrator
# state) lives at .notongit/NeuroGolf_nogit/ inside the repo — 3.4 GB, never committed.
.notongit/
handoff_request.json
Logs/*.out.log
# Ad-hoc mining/probe scratch — promote analytical CSV/MD summaries to tracked Logs/ at session end.
Logs/scratch/

# --- Regenerable prototype scratch (large binary caches + per-seed verification dumps) ---
# Synth-context / oracle caches (.npz up to ~19 MB each) and pickled arrays — regenerable from build scripts.
*.npz
*.pkl
# Per-seed synthetic-gate / verification result dumps under prototypes/ (hundreds of files, regenerable).
**/prototypes/*_synthetic_gate_*.json
**/prototypes/*_gate_results.json
**/prototypes/*_adversarial*.json
# Debug visualizations + console result dumps under prototypes/ (regenerable scratch).
**/prototypes/*.html
**/prototypes/*.png
**/prototypes/*_result.txt

# --- Local Hermes / Codex worktrees ---
.worktrees/

# --- runs.jsonl archives ---
*.archive
# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- ARC-GEN ground-truth generator (independent oracle; 61MB vendored, not tracked) ---
/external/ARC-GEN/

# worker scratch dumps in prototype dirs
**/prototypes/*.out
**/prototypes/bd_*

# --- HandOff local workspace ---
# Keep shareable docs/exports under Handoff/, but never commit secrets,
# runtime logs, raw API captures, or private scratch.
Handoff/private/
Handoff/tmp/
Handoff/logs/
Handoff/export/private/
Handoff/Research/*_Packet_*.zip
Handoff/Research/*_Packet_*_Manifest.csv
Handoff/Research/*_Packet_*_Build_Report.md
Handoff/Research/*_Packet_README_*.md
Handoff/**/*.secret.*
Handoff/**/*token*
Handoff/**/*key*

# --- Team-local handoff/package artifacts ---
# The public archive keeps the canonical upload payload under submissions/.
Team/

# Generated by tools/repo_lint.py on every run (was tracked; dropped 2026-07-15 as a generated artifact)
Logs/lint_last.md
